    <summary>A digital photo suite of ten focused photo editing software tools for Windows that resize, retouch, watermark and restore pictures, priced about 70% below the separate programs.</summary>
    <description>This package installs SoftOrbits Digital Photo Suite - Photo Editing Bundle, a digital photo suite of ten Windows programs for retouching, resizing, watermarking and restoring photos. Each tool opens in its own window with a short list of options, which makes it easy to hand a single task to a colleague on another office PC.

![SoftOrbits Digital Photo Suite screenshot 1](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/dps/dps-v1-resize.png)

## How to use SoftOrbits Digital Photo Suite

1. Install the package and open the program you need from the suite folder in the Start menu.
2. Add a photo or a whole set of files.
3. Choose the settings or a preset and look at the preview.
4. Save the output to a folder of your choice.
5. Continue in the next tool if the job has more steps.

Trial note: the trial is free and asks for no registration, so every program can be tested on real pictures. Buying a license lifts the trial restrictions.

![SoftOrbits Digital Photo Suite screenshot 2](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/dps/dps-v1-watermark.png)

## Ten programs in one photo editing bundle

- AI Photo Editor for edits described in a text prompt.
- Batch Picture Resizer for folders of photos that need one size or format.
- Photo Retoucher for old prints with scratches, noise or missing color.
- SoftSkin Photo Makeup for portraits.
- Photo Background Remover, which can also place the subject on a white backdrop.
- Batch Picture Protector for watermarks, and Photo Stamp Remover for removing stamps and logos from your own pictures.
- Sketch Drawer and Picture to Painting Converter for artistic effects.
- Flash Drive Recovery for photos lost from a card or stick.

![SoftOrbits Digital Photo Suite screenshot 3](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/dps/dps-v1-retouch.png)

## Photo editing software for batch jobs and repairs

This photo editing software set is aimed at repeated, practical tasks rather than layer-based design. A shop can resize a catalog and stamp a logo on it in two passes, and a family archive can be cleaned up print by print.

## Who it is for

Photographers, small offices and home users on Windows 11 or 10 who want several narrow tools under one purchase, bought as a photo editing bundle instead of ten separate orders. A business licence covers use of the digital photo suite on company computers.

## Trial and license

The package installs the free trial of a commercial program, and full use needs a license. Lifetime, 1-year, monthly plan and business options are offered, and a license removes the trial limits in all ten programs.

Pricing and the list of programs are on the [SoftOrbits Digital Photo Suite](https://www.softorbits.net/digital-photo-suite/?utm_source=chocolatey&amp;utm_medium=package) page.

## FAQ

### What editing software do photographers rely on?

Most combine a main editor with smaller tools for routine work. This bundle supplies the routine part, such as resizing whole folders, watermarking and fixing old scans.

### How can I edit JPG photos for free without going online?

Install the trial of this suite and open your JPG files in the program you need. Nothing is uploaded, and you can judge the result before paying.

### Is any photo editor fully free?

Free editors exist, but this suite is a paid product with a no-cost trial. You can test each program first and buy a license only if it fits your work.
